1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,410
I went the wrong way.

2
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,680
Are you hurt?

3
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:29,800
No.

4
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,400
I found an archive room.

5
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,080
There's a national map on the wall,

6
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,480
with many locations marked.

7
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,280
Let's get out of here. Follow me.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,800
West side.

9
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,240
Go.

10
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,280
Can you open it?

11
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,200
This is a nine-ring lock.

12
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,320
One wrong move,

13
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:18,120
and all nine layers will lock up.

14
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,760
Stand behind me.

15
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,680
The fifth group has been altered.

16
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,840
It's not nine layers.

17
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,000
It's ten.

18
00:01:32,479 --> 00:01:33,960
Where is the extra layer?

19
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,160
Go.

20
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:53,960
Father.

21
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,640
Why didn't you stop them?

22
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,840
Stopping him is easy.

23
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:59,880
I wanted him to see those ancient texts.

24
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,680
You fought him.

25
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,160
What did you learn?

26
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,280
You didn't lose in technique.

27
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,960
He saw the structure.

28
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,520
You only saw the moves.

29
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:17,400
Xuan Chen's disciple at your age

30
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:21,130
could already operate three wooden armor guards simultaneously.

31
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:24,280
I am truly no match for him.

32
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,800
These are all construction nodes handled by the Mo family,

33
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,360
but they only marked the general directions,

34
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,690
no specific locations.

35
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:48,560
Wealth, illness, separation, righteousness, official, robbery, harm, origin.

36
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,800
They are arranged according to the Eight Trigrams.

37
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,280
The places the Mo family has touched

38
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,520
are far more than the few we've discovered.

39
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,200
Also.

40
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:59,120
My master's disappearance is related to them.

41
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,920
Your master,

42
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,200
the Yang branch of the Yanshi,

43
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:01,800
Xuan Chen.

44
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,800
My master has been missing for ten years.

45
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:06,000
I found clues about him in the underground palace of the Mo family shrine.

46
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,840
He seems to be trapped somewhere.

47
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,000
Since it's the Mo family,

48
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,400
our goals are the same.

49
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,600
This is his heart.

50
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,040
It's not that he originally had a heart.

51
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,160
The Lingshu only acts when his old injuries flare up,

52
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,920
to stabilize his blood and soul.

53
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,280
How many runes are on it?

54
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,480
Seventy-two.

55
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:38,360
Every single one must align with his blood, bones, and breath.

56
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,640
One mistake and it hurts.

57
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:42,970
The Yanshi's wooden armor guards are just like the legends.

58
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,240
They were originally dying creatures,

59
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,960
encountered by a destined Yanshi,

60
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,800
reborn through Yanshu,

61
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,200
and nurtured for years,

62
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,450
until they gained their approval.

63
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,760
It's truly amazing.

64
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,800
He doesn't like being touched by others.

65
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,660
He's ticklish.

66
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,920
When you talk to them,

67
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,320
they really understand.

68
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,320
They understand.

69
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,600
But whether they do it or not,

70
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,200
they decide for themselves.

71
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,240
Ah.

72
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,280
Sorry.

73
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,760
I just wanted to help you up.

74
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,600
It's fine.

75
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,519
Thank you.

76
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,360
Qinghe. Qinghe.

77
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,140
I'm here, Old Zhou.

78
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:26,440
Qinghe.

79
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,760
Something happened to Xiaotang from the Tang family.

80
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,800
The head of the Tang family wants you to go over immediately.

81
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,000
What happened to Xiaotang?

82
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,680
She went to the ancient pagoda to check the repairs last week.

83
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,920
She came back with a strange disease.

84
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,520
Half of her body is covered with wood grain.

85
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:38,800
Several hospitals and sorcerers couldn't find the cause.

86
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,760
Tell Uncle Tang.

87
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,720
I'll set off right away.

88
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,600
Something happened to the Tang family.

89
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,000
Let's go.

90
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,600
Okay.

91
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,600
The Tang Sect's mechanism skills are really amazing.

92
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,000
Unless they encounter a strong enemy,

93
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,530
the Tang family won't turn on the mechanisms.

94
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,620
Be careful.

95
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,400
There are hundreds of mechanisms here.

96
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,660
Even hundreds of enemies can't break in.

97
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,680
You are very familiar with the Tang family.

98
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,640
Uncle Tang is my master's best friend.

99
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,640
Xiaotang learned a little from us since childhood.

100
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,800
She is considered my junior sister.

101
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,560
On the map in the Mohist archives,

102
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,640
there is also a red dot near the mountain city.

103
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:23,080
Okay, let's go first.

104
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,200
Qinghe,

105
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,400
you're finally here.

106
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,160
Xiaotang, she...

107
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,000
Uncle Tang,

108
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,330
take me to see her first.

109
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,360
Okay.

110
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,280
Okay.

111
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,520
Follow me.

112
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,240
You guys just go in.

113
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,560
I still have some mundane matters to deal with.

114
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,000
Okay.

115
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,520
We'll go in now.

116
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,000
Brother,

117
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,200
you're here.

118
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,960
It's just that my skin is a bit hard.

119
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,760
It's nothing.

120
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,720
Is this my sister-in-law?

121
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,960
No, you misunderstood.

122
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,960
I'm Su Wan,

123
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,920
his friend.

124
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,280
Don't mess around.

125
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,040
You call him Qinghe,

126
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,680
and you're just friends?

127
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,600
Say less.

128
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,440
She's here to help.

129
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,880
Hello, Sister Wanwan.

130
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,140
Just call me Xiaotang.

131
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,210
Do you feel anything at all?

132
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:24,640
No.

133
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,560
Sometimes,

134
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:29,000
I can't even feel my own heartbeat.

135
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,159
What did you touch in the ancient pagoda?

136
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:35,560
There was a circle of runes in the corner of the top floor.

137
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,159
I just touched it,

138
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,020
and red gas pierced my finger.

139
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,880
I saw a man tied to a wooden stake,

140
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,040
his chest full of wooden nails.

141
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,570
Then I lost consciousness.

142
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:46,960
When I woke up,

143
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:49,620
I had been lying in the hospital for two days.

144
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,000
That person's face,

145
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,260
do you still remember?

146
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,940
Wearing disc goggles,

147
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,840
with an ink pen pinned to his chest,

148
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,960
like a teacher from an old dynasty academy.

149
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,520
I invited several sorcerers

150
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,180
and also went to the hospital.

151
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:03,120
They could only keep her awake.

152
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,090
No one could remove this curse.

153
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,080
This is a woodification curse.

154
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,740
It's draining your vitality,

155
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:12,480
slowly turning your body into part of the warding object.

156
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,760
I just wanted to try

157
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,520
the cracking formula you taught me.

158
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,360
You dare to touch the Yin talisman with your little skill?

159
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,160
If Uncle Tang had notified me a few days later,

160
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,290
you really wouldn't have made it back.

161
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,600
Brother.

162
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,820
Will I completely turn into a puppet?

163
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,880
No.

164
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,960
I will cure you.
